(7532973, 1205045, 103142, '<td valign="top">Nope. Too set up of a shot. If it was a found knitters couch, it would be much messier!<br/> <br/>Hmmmm... double pointed needle style? Have you tried the toe up magic loop method? I always got bored after making one sock and wanted to move on to a new sock yarn. Knitting two at a time was so cool! I actually finished some pairs of socks that way!<br/> <br/>I don''t know if the photo is that interesting to others, but it''s warm and happy for me. 7.5, so I''m rounding to an 8.</td>', 'Nope. Too set up of a shot. If it was a found knitters couch, it would be much messier! Hmmmm... double pointed needle style? Have you tried the toe up magic loop method? I always got bored after making one sock and wanted to move on to a new sock yarn. Knitting two at a time was so cool! I actually finished some pairs of socks that way! I don''t know if the photo is that interesting to others, but it''s warm and happy for me. 7.5, so I''m rounding to an 8.', '2017-09-04 10:27:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(7532975, 1205096, 103142, '<td valign="top">Very nice! So far most of the photos have been a bit bland. But this is really nice! Can decide 7 or 8. But since it has a great initial impact, going 7.5 which rounds to an 8.</td>', 'Very nice! So far most of the photos have been a bit bland. But this is really nice! Can decide 7 or 8. But since it has a great initial impact, going 7.5 which rounds to an 8.', '2017-09-04 10:31:02.000000', NULL, 1),
