(7534089, 1205066, 115814, '<td valign="top">A well-seen tableau. Every part is relevant to the story, without detracting from the three subjects. The undersized chairs add an interesting dimension. Bump.</td>', 'A well-seen tableau. Every part is relevant to the story, without detracting from the three subjects. The undersized chairs add an interesting dimension. Bump.', '2017-09-08 16:10:58.000000', NULL, 1),
