(7534091, 1205095, 115814, '<td valign="top">Where the exhibition space becomes the exhibition... Great lines, shapes, colors, and comp. Bravo!</td>', 'Where the exhibition space becomes the exhibition... Great lines, shapes, colors, and comp. Bravo!', '2017-09-08 16:12:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534092, 1204487, 115814, '<td valign="top">Oddly compelling.</td>', 'Oddly compelling.', '2017-09-08 16:14:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534108, 1205050, 115814, '<td valign="top">Well... it''s way out of focus and doesn''t "pop." The whites are blown out and the blacks lack detail. The (apparent) subject is not centered or placed to follow the rule of thirds. It''s hard to make out what exactly the subject is and where there''s a sofa, chair, or bed. I''d have a hard time giving this anything over a 1 or 2. <br/> <br/>...except that it''s so dang mesmerizing to look at, and the ambiguity of the title along with the implications of the lines, shapes, and light create a fascinating window to a story I''d like to know more about. Wow.</td>', 'Well... it''s way out of focus and doesn''t "pop." The whites are blown out and the blacks lack detail. The (apparent) subject is not centered or placed to follow the rule of thirds. It''s hard to make out what exactly the subject is and where there''s a sofa, chair, or bed. I''d have a hard time giving this anything over a 1 or 2.  ...except that it''s so dang mesmerizing to look at, and the ambiguity of the title along with the implications of the lines, shapes, and light create a fascinating window to a story I''d like to know more about. Wow.', '2017-09-08 17:06:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534109, 1204618, 115814, '<td valign="top">Shady AND completely self-aware.</td>', 'Shady AND completely self-aware.', '2017-09-08 17:07:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534112, 1205008, 115814, '<td valign="top">This might have been effective as a more traditionally processed image. BUT... this treatment really creates a powerful version of the scene. An exceptional use of the digital process. Bravo!</td>', 'This might have been effective as a more traditionally processed image. BUT... this treatment really creates a powerful version of the scene. An exceptional use of the digital process. Bravo!', '2017-09-08 17:12:37.000000', NULL, 1),
