(7534126, 1204733, 115814, '<td valign="top">The depiction of homeless tends to be a controversial subject. Personally, I don''t object, but others may. My scoring of your image is not affected by content. <br/> <br/>I scored this in my below average range because the photo itself is cluttered, has little compositional coherence and the human subjects are obscured by the shadows. In general, there''s just too much going on for my tastes. It might be improved by the selective brightening of the people in the shadows.</td>', 'The depiction of homeless tends to be a controversial subject. Personally, I don''t object, but others may. My scoring of your image is not affected by content.  I scored this in my below average range because the photo itself is cluttered, has little compositional coherence and the human subjects are obscured by the shadows. In general, there''s just too much going on for my tastes. It might be improved by the selective brightening of the people in the shadows.', '2017-09-08 18:30:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(7534128, 1204842, 115814, '<td valign="top">I scored this in my below average range because the photo has little compositional coherence. Without the title, it would be tough to understand the intent of the large foreground portion of the image being taken by the leather chair.</td>', 'I scored this in my below average range because the photo has little compositional coherence. Without the title, it would be tough to understand the intent of the large foreground portion of the image being taken by the leather chair.', '2017-09-08 18:33:31.000000', NULL, 1),
