(7534564, 1204995, 109227, '<td valign="top">Congrats on the Blue Bear; terrific and fun image.  Until you asked about cropping the lady on right out, I did not really notice her.  The color balances the image imo.</td>', 'Congrats on the Blue Bear; terrific and fun image.  Until you asked about cropping the lady on right out, I did not really notice her.  The color balances the image imo.', '2017-09-11 20:43:15.000000', NULL, 0),
