(7534786, 1205104, 100831, '<td valign="top">That''s really quite nice.  Lovely atmospheric qualities and light. Congrats.</td>', 'That''s really quite nice.  Lovely atmospheric qualities and light. Congrats.', '2017-09-13 00:20:22.000000', NULL, 0),
(7534901, 1204995, 7910, '<td valign="top">Fantastic shot Bear!  Did you know that couple and plan the outfits?  His yellow shirt on blue chair and her blue on yellow couldn''t have been better.   As far as the other woman, at first I thought maybe cropping but then see how her shirt picks up on the flower baskets.   Great find on color play.</td>', 'Fantastic shot Bear!  Did you know that couple and plan the outfits?  His yellow shirt on blue chair and her blue on yellow couldn''t have been better.   As far as the other woman, at first I thought maybe cropping but then see how her shirt picks up on the flower baskets.   Great find on color play.', '2017-09-13 09:14:17.000000', NULL, 0),
(7534946, 1204995, 96751, '<td valign="top">This just oozes charm.  And summer.</td>', 'This just oozes charm.  And summer.', '2017-09-13 18:06:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(7534947, 1205104, 96751, '<td valign="top">I think it''s the shadow that puts this over the top :)</td>', 'I think it''s the shadow that puts this over the top :)', '2017-09-13 18:07:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(7534959, 1204995, 35602, '<td valign="top">Congrats. Love the summery feel. I stills such feelings of warmth and memories. Wonderful image.<br/></td>', 'Congrats. Love the summery feel. I stills such feelings of warmth and memories. Wonderful image.', '2017-09-13 20:46:54.000000', NULL, 0),
